    "text": "procedure Show_Executable_Semantics\n  with SPARK_Mode => On\nis\n   function Add (X, Y : Integer) return Integer is (X + Y)\n     with Pre => X + Y in Integer;\n\n   X : Integer;\nbegin\n   X := Add (Integer'Last, 1);\nend Show_Executable_Semantics;\n",
